{{!
    @template tool_vae/notes_orphans

    The annotations of the situations of a record that were deleted: a heading, then each former situation apart, said
    deleted, with its lines. Nothing when there is none.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\notes_orphans. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except one key:
    * lineshtml - the lines of a former situation, drawn by the template tool_vae/note_lines

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * section - object or null: heading; groups, an array of {title, lineshtml}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "section": {
            "heading": "Annotations",
            "groups": [
                {"title": "Work situation 2 - deleted", "lineshtml": "<p class=\"small text-muted\">Validates nothing.</p>"}
            ]
        }
    }
}}
{{#section}}<section class="tool-vae-notes mt-4"><h3 class="h5">{{heading}}</h3>{{#groups}}<h4 class="h6">{{title}}</h4>{{!
}}{{{lineshtml}}}{{/groups}}</section>{{/section}}
